I've found that if Excalibur (or any artifact, for that matter) does not
yet exist in your current game, then if a bones pile contains that
artifact, it will retain its name, enchantments, and I think also its
rust-proof status. But if that artifact already exists (or existed and
was destroyed), the bones artifact loses its name.

